    "legacy_jewellery_editorial_GmxRyY": {
      "type": "legacy-jewellery-editorial",
      "name": "Jewellery Editorial",
      "settings": {
        "accessibility_label": "Legacy jewellery house editorial section",
        "eyebrow": "The conscious choice",
        "heading": "A LEGACY\nJEWELLERY HOUSE\nREIMAGINED FOR TODAY.",
        "body_text": "<p>In 1975, Mangal Royal Jewels was founded on two things that cannot be bought — trust and craftsmanship. For decades, families across generations have walked through our doors and left carrying more than jewellery. They carried a piece of an institution that truly understood what fine jewellery means: not just the weight of gold or the clarity of stone, but the weight of emotion and the clarity of occasion.</p><p>Mangal Royal Studio is the next chapter of this story. Born from the same house, informed by the same values — but designed for a new generation of discerning, conscious and deeply personal luxury.</p><p>Every piece at Mangal Royal Studio is designed to celebrate emotions, milestones and everyday luxury in a way that feels timeless yet deeply relevant to who you are today.</p>",
        "quote": "\"Luxury today is not just about what you wear.\nIt's about the choices you make.\"",
        "back_image": "shopify://shop_images/832f60664a5381eb7addb5fef2ce71e8ae897c6f_1.jpg",
